Embedded reference-derived assets
---------------------------------

1. Session system prompts
   - Port location: crates/oc-session/assets/prompt/*.txt
   - Reference source: reference/packages/opencode/src/session/prompt/*.txt
   - Status: verbatim (diff-verified identical to the vendored reference).
   - License: MIT (upstream), see LICENSE.

2. Tool prompts
   - Port location: crates/oc-tool/src/prompts/*.txt
   - Reference source: reference/packages/opencode/src/tool/*.txt
   - Status: verbatim (diff-verified identical to the vendored reference).
   - License: MIT (upstream), see LICENSE.

3. Plugin runtime polyfill
   - Port location: crates/oc-plugin/src/polyfill/runtime.js
   - Reference source: derived from the `@opencode-ai/plugin` runtime API
     surface (reference/packages/plugin/src and reference/packages/opencode/src/plugin).
   - Status: derived work reimplementing the plugin runtime for the in-process
     QuickJS host.
   - License: MIT (upstream), see LICENSE.

4. Model catalog
   - Port location: crates/oc-provider/data/models.json
   - Reference source: https://models.opencode.ai/api.json (models.dev),
     snapshotted at build/release time by the upstream project; the port embeds
     a snapshot regenerated from the same URL. Not a copy of the vendored
     reference tree. Data provenance and refresh policy are tracked in
     SUPPLY-007 of rust-port-audit/16-dependencies-supply-chain.md.
   - License: see upstream models.dev terms; MIT-compatible permissive.

