------------------

All crates.io dependencies are permissively licensed (MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC,
BSD, Unicode-3.0, Zlib, MPL-2.0, CDLA-Permissive). No GPL/AGPL code is used.
The full dependency list and checksums are in Cargo.lock. Notably:
